        "@value": "closed vocabulary, 9 codes; each code is a skos:Concept in https://fdb.cdl.correlaid.org/def/fdb#foerderberechtigte, which carries its label"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain": [
